Zaeluv
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 22 ROTATE 3 U 3
UKU 4 FACE_ALL
UKU 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE UKU UKU
AND
    OR
        DEST Size > 9
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
    DESTSRC Rank add_14
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL UKU Empty
        PILE ALL UKU Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
